# OCaml API

The parser is available as an OCaml library, the `djot` package.

``` ocaml
let doc = Djot.Doc.of_string ~locs:true "# hi\n\n*strong* and [a](b)\n"
let html = Djot.Html.of_doc doc
```

- [API reference](odoc/djot/): the generated documentation.
- [Source code](https://github.com/hon-gyu/djot.v/tree/main/ocaml)

The package is not on opam yet. The repository's `ocaml` branch holds the
package at its root, for use as a vendored directory or a git submodule.

